# Squad: union merge for append-only team state files
#
# .squad/decisions.md and .squad/agents/*/history.md were removed by the
# .claude/ framework migration (see .claude/docs/decisions.md, "Migrated
# the squad framework from the old layout" entry): the decision ledger now
# lives at .claude/docs/decisions.md, and there is no current single
# append-only history.md per agent (cross-session agent memory now lives
# under .claude/agent-memory/<name>/*.md as separate files, a different
# shape that doesn't need this same merge strategy).
.claude/docs/decisions.md merge=union
.squad/log/** merge=union
.squad/orchestration-log/** merge=union
